Well, we don't always give what the basic,uncursed scroll would do if it were
read.  The scroll of punishment obviously (when you read it) does those two
things: the message and the ball.  So we did not include it.  But it was good
for us to include most of the confused ones, for sometimes different things
happen when confused, and confusion is so common, why not? So it was not so
much an accident(like missing the former one) but an intentional omission.

